## About the standard

Part 4-1 sets process requirements for manufacturers' secure development lifecycle of industrial control system products, from requirements definition to vulnerability management and product end-of-life.

Official source: [IEC 62443-4-1:2018](https://webstore.iec.ch/en/publication/33615).

